{"url": "https://theranetrix.com/services/", "content_type": "text/html; charset=UTF-8", "language_hint": "en-US", "text": "Healthcare Technology Solutions | Wellesley, MA | TheraNetrix, Inc.\nExplore TheraNetrix, Inc.'s AI-powered CDSS, patient engagement platforms, and clinical trial tools for advanced pain management in Wellesley, MA.\nExplore TheraNetrix, Inc.'s AI-powered CDSS, patient engagement platforms, and clinical trial tools for advanced pain management in Wellesley, MA.\nHealthcare Technology Solutions | Wellesley, MA | TheraNetrix, Inc. Home Services TheraNetrix CDSS MobileNetrix Patient Application Clinical Trial Support / Studies About About TheraNetrix, Inc. Management Clinician Advisory Panel News & Events Contact Us Home Services TheraNetrix CDSS MobileNetrix Patient Application Clinical Trial Support / Studies About About TheraNetrix, Inc. Management Clinician Advisory Panel News & Events Contact Us Healthcare Technology Solutions TheraNetrix, Inc. offers a unified suite of digital health solutions designed to improve chronic and acute pain management. From clinical decision support to patient engagement and research tools, our technologies empower clinicians, support patients, and elevate the standard of care across healthcare systems. TheraNetrix Clinical Decision Support System (CDSS) TheraNetrix CDSS is our flagship clinical platform that helps clinicians optimize pain treatment using predictive, AI-powered insights. Integrated with Digital Twin technology and Quantitative Systems Pharmacology (QSP) models, it delivers personalized combination drug therapy recommendations. Revolutionizing Pain Management Built over a decade of development, TheraNetrix CDSS unites the patient-facing MobileNetrix app with the Prescribing Support Tool licensed from In Silico Biosciences, Inc., simulating patient responses to guide safer and more effective treatments. Powered by Digital Twin Technology Digital Twins integrate clinical, behavioral, environmental, and wearable data to build dynamic, individualized care models—continuously refined through real-time feedback for enhanced accuracy and fairness. Clinician-Focused, Outcome-Driven Predict pain relief outcomes and side effects Minimize trial-and-error prescribing Improve adherence and satisfaction Facilitate shared decision-making Evidence-Based, Scalable, Intelligent This scalable tool aligns with trends in digital health, personalized medicine, and value-based care—supporting both individual patient care and population-level health analysis. MobileNetrix™ Patient Application MobileNetrix™ is a modular, patient-facing platform designed to facilitate continuous engagement, symptom tracking, and treatment adherence. Developed with leading pain experts, it supports both clinical practice and research applications. Empowering Patients Through Connection Report symptoms and medication effects Access psychological and educational resources Set personalized health goals and monitor progress A Clinical Tool and Research Companion Highly adaptable and modular, the platform supports: PROM collection and post-visit feedback Symptom triage and specialist scheduling Delivery of treatment modules based on condition Built for Security and Integration All data is securely housed in HIPAA-compliant systems, integrated with EMRs, and available for aggregate analytics to support research, care improvement, and compliance. Epidemiology Evaluation Tracking and Treatments Clinical Communication Data Mining Clinical Trial Support & Research Tools TheraNetrix provides robust infrastructure for executing clinical studies, public health initiatives, and population health research—all within the MobileNetrix ecosystem. Expand Research with Confidence Study design and protocol development Patient recruitment and engagement Real-time compliance and monitoring Regulatory-compliant data validation Built for Investigators and Institutions Use MobileNetrix to: Monitor treatment adherence and safety events Manage informed consent and communication Distribute educational content and track responses Analytics and Outcomes Measurement Extract trends from real-world datasets Track study protocol fidelity Enhance funding applications and publications Research-Grade, Patient-First Our platforms are flexible, secure, and designed with clinical and research needs in mind—improving operations while putting the patient experience at the center. Learn how our technology transforms pain care Explore Our Solutions Address TheraNetrix Inc. 17 Brook Street, Wellesley MA 02482 Contact Phone: 617 763 7457 | 781 235 1995 Email: info@theranetrix.com Services About News & Events Contact Us More links Legal notice Privacy policy LinkedIn This project has received funding from the European Union’s Horizon 2020 research and innovation program under grant agreement No 848068 © 2026 TheraNetrix, Inc."}
